id: pm-windows-lookup-proof
title: Capture native lookup evidence and reject interrupted command-absence proof
description: "Native Windows Node24 cohort job121994981615 in CI40445155345 at metadata head8c8c7586a reports a genuinely missing literal executable as assertion_failure, despite retaining the expected shell diagnostic and native exit1. It failed both native test attempts. The identical production/test source passed every hosted check at8bedb5f77. The confirming resolver currently uses bounded where.exe execution, but this run did not capture its actual status, signal or duration, so probe timeout or environment variation is a hypothesis rather than a confirmed cause. Preserve the raw failure and compare one fresh native-cohort rerun before selecting a fix. CI link: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/actions/runs/40445155345/job/121994981615"
