acceptance_criteria: Capture actual Windows resolver status signal and duration with the same child environment and working directory; Separate confirmed command absence from unavailable proof without trusting arbitrary child diagnostics; Retain bounded lookup behavior native exit status exact stderr and installed-child127 or ENOENT negative controls
parent: pm-gh1604
risk: medium
confidence: high
resolution: "Capture real native child/resolver status, signal, killed flag, duration, cwd and effective environment equality without replacing OS results. Make the required gate assert classification from independent proof, and reject interrupted numeric absence statuses. Keep the required Windows cohort, raw status/stderr, installed-child controls and one-second budget."
expected_result: "A completed fresh negative lookup establishes spawn_error; unavailable or interrupted evidence stays assertion_failure. Native child and probe use equal effective environments and cwd, and pinned unsafe-source replays fail only the intended assertion."
actual_result: "All43 linked native/lookup tests and all118 connected tests pass locally; focused coverage is47/47 statements,53/53 branches,6/6 functions,40/40 lines. Actual Windows source862 logs code1/no signal/no kill at476.7433ms and equal child context. Its native cohort and full100/100/100/100 source coverage pass. The pinned interrupted-proof counterexample fails as intended; no historical cause is invented."
