  "2026-10-27T04:08:07.696Z","harness:codex","Fresh native cohort attempt2 succeeds on identical8c8c7586a production/test source: job122000399134 https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/actions/runs/40445155345/job/122000399134 and dependent Windows gate122002600907 both pass. This confirms variation across native attempts, not a source repair or a proven timeout cause. The whole workflow still fails the separate known planner fields on the immutable8c intake; those metadata fields are corrected locally for the next head. Keep the resolver investigation open/unclaimed and preserve the failed first attempt."
  "2026-10-27T07:45:32.591Z","harness:codex","Review4386092218 correctly challenges an unconditional native assertion when the bounded external resolver can be unavailable. Keep the required Windows test and unchanged1s bound. Capture the actual native execFile boundary, status/signal/killed/duration and sanitized environment/cwd evidence, then require the classification dictated by that independent observed proof. An absent probe or wrong classification must still fail. Do not infer the historical failure cause or remove the required cohort. No production test-only seam or new public API is needed."
  "2026-10-27T07:54:21.829Z","harness:codex","Source audit found a distinct reproducible conservative-proof defect: an error with numeric absence code1/127 plus killed=true or signal=SIGTERM was accepted as absence. Four external-boundary cases fail before the guard and pass afterward. Interrupted/unavailable proof now declines regardless of numeric code. This does not establish the historical Windows attempt cause. The native passthrough observer records actual child/resolver identity and outcomes without replacing OS results, printing environment values, or adding a production seam; the required cohort and1s budget stay intact."
  "2026-10-27T07:57:22.525Z","harness:codex","Connected acceptance passes locally: all118 assertions across history recency2, native linked-command2, lookup41 and linked-runner73; the linked native/lookup cohort passes43 tests. Exact lookup coverage is47/47 statements,53/53 branches,6/6 functions,40/40 lines, with zero uncovered counts. TypeScript and focused ESLint pass. Native instrumentation compares effective environment values without requiring object identity and emits sanitized status/signal/kill/duration/cwd evidence. Actual hosted Windows capture and fresh exact-head source admission remain required before this investigation is closed."
  "2026-10-27T08:09:13.621Z","harness:codex","Portable counterexample evidence: frozen candidate 862c800cfe785da6e80a2490318b81586615465b with only src/sdk/test/command-resolution.ts changed. The preimage is a967abee7afff03cdb9b2e2fba7d206c7b497313; the newest-history condition changes only newestFirst to false. Each named case independently requires exactly one expected AssertionError, its specific matcher fragment, empty suite-error messages and native exit1. Unexpected/runtime/setup outcomes refuse proof with3. All applicable cases were independently executed now; passing local checks and historical immutable events remain separate."
  "2026-10-27T08:32:36.488Z","harness:codex","Actual hosted Windows proof: source862c800cfe785da6e80a2490318b81586615465b, CI40470864579 native job122077768670 captures where.exe code1, signal=null, killed=false, duration476.7433ms within the1000ms budget; working directory D:/a/pm-cli/pm-cli matches the real child, effective environment equality=true and SystemRoot/ComSpec/PATH/PATHEXT names are present without logging values. The required cohort passes. Exact full-source coverage job122081493455 passes100/100/100/100 with zero uncovered counts. Controlled interrupted-provider cases prove refusal independently; the historical failed attempt cause remains unproven. DeepScan has not published this source status, so global merge readiness is still refused separately."
